 "reading": "On the base the hero painting change with the flat preview on screen shows no frame over 34 ms in 9 change windows per profile (3 runs): desktop worst 33.3 ms (2 frames over 20 ms), phone worst 16.8 ms; with no box near the screen desktop worst 16.8 ms, phone 16.8 ms. So the bar the head must meet for R55 is: no frame over 34 ms and a worst frame of at most 33.3 ms on desktop (16.8 ms on the phone) inside the hero change windows with a box on screen, with the same tool. The earlier review (Opus, 436d96c..1ebfe73) saw 50 to 83 ms frames in change windows in the base build too, in the full home-scroll runs (the change landing inside or just after the scroll passes, not in these held pages): that is the hero change own cost (RB8, a finding for Task 20), not R55 cost, and is not the bar here."
}
